WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:08.241
♪ ♪

00:00:08.242 --> 00:00:08.630
♪ ♪

00:00:08.631 --> 00:00:10.961
&gt;&gt; Chris: OUR NEXT GUEST HAS

00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:13.701
CALLED THE BIDEN

00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:14.625
ADMINISTRATION’S IMMIGRATION

00:00:14.626 --> 00:00:17.584
PLAN RECRUIT AND RELEASE.
JOINING US NOW, ARCING,

00:00:19.854 --> 00:00:22.189
ARKANSASSENATOR TOM COTTON.

00:00:22.223 --> 00:00:22.514
ARKANSASSENATOR TOM COTTON.

00:00:22.516 --> 00:00:23.100
WELCOME BACK.

00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:24.694
&gt;&gt; Senator Cotton: GOOD TO BE

00:00:24.695 --> 00:00:26.332
ON WITH YOU, CHRIS.

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:27.982
&gt;&gt; Chris: YOU JUST WATCHED MY

00:00:27.983 --> 00:00:31.260
INTERVIEW WITH SECRETARY

00:00:31.294 --> 00:00:33.069
MAYORKAS, YOUR REACTION, SIR?

00:00:33.104 --> 00:00:34.354
&gt;&gt; Senator Cotton: CHRIS, IT’S

00:00:34.388 --> 00:00:35.391
RICH THAT SECRETARY MAYORKAS

00:00:35.393 --> 00:00:36.431
WON’T LET PRESS TRAVEL WITH HIM

00:00:36.465 --> 00:00:38.780
TO THE BORDER, BUT HE WILL COME

00:00:38.781 --> 00:00:40.966
ON YOUR SUNDAY MORNING SHOW AND

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.243
PEDDLE THE SAME KIND OF NONSENSE

00:00:42.245 --> 00:00:44.267
THAT HAS CREATED THE BIDEN

00:00:44.268 --> 00:00:46.067
BORDER CRISIS IN THE FIRST

00:00:46.101 --> 00:00:46.380
PLACE.

00:00:46.381 --> 00:00:47.236
I MEAN, HE’S BASICALLY SAYING

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.205
THE UNITED STATES WILL NOT

00:00:49.206 --> 00:00:50.959
SECURE OUR BORDER AND THAT IS A

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.646
BIG WELCOME SIGN TO MIGRANTS

00:00:53.681 --> 00:00:55.054
FROM ACROSS THE WORLD.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.331
&gt;&gt; Chris: SO YOU SAY THAT YOU

00:00:57.365 --> 00:01:00.432
HAVE THREE SIMPLE SOLUTIONS.

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:02.311
WHAT ARE THEY?

00:01:02.345 --> 00:01:03.980
&gt;&gt; Senator Cotton: YEAH,

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:05.017
CHRIS, THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION

00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:06.671
KEEPS SAYING THAT TRUMP SOMEHOW

00:01:06.673 --> 00:01:07.549
DISMANTLED THE IMMIGRATION

00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:08.293
SYSTEM.

00:01:08.327 --> 00:01:09.275
THAT’S FALSE.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.059
IT WAS THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION

00:01:11.093 --> 00:01:12.517
THAT DISMANTLED THREE HIGHLY

00:01:12.518 --> 00:01:13.012
EFFECTIVE POLICIES.

00:01:13.013 --> 00:01:14.609
FIRST, THE PUBLIC HEALTH

00:01:14.611 --> 00:01:15.049
EXCLUSIONARY ORDER.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:17.579
THEY LIFTED THAT ORDER AS IT

00:01:17.581 --> 00:01:18.246
RELATES TO MINORS.

00:01:18.247 --> 00:01:19.740
WELL, GUESS WHAT WE HAVE NOW

00:01:19.741 --> 00:01:21.101
WITH THE BORDER?

00:01:21.103 --> 00:01:22.431
LOTS MORE MINORS.

00:01:22.432 --> 00:01:24.146
THAT’S NOT A SURPRISE.

00:01:24.148 --> 00:01:25.391
SECOND, THE "REMAIN IN MEXICO"

00:01:25.426 --> 00:01:25.679
POLICY.

00:01:25.713 --> 00:01:27.527
THE TRUMP ADMINISTRATION WORKED

00:01:27.529 --> 00:01:29.191
WITH THE GOVERNMENT OF MEXICO TO

00:01:29.193 --> 00:01:31.259
ALLOW MIGRANTS WHO SHOWED UP ON

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:32.905
OUR BORDER TO MAKE AN ASYLUM

00:01:32.906 --> 00:01:34.592
CLAIM BUT REMAIN IN MEXICO WHILE

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:36.007
WE ADJUDICATED RATHER THAN JUST

00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:38.024
RELEASING THEM INTO THE COUNTRY

00:01:38.025 --> 00:01:39.245
AND THIRD, THE SO-CALLED SAFE

00:01:39.246 --> 00:01:40.549
THIRD COUNTRY AGREEMENT WITH

00:01:40.584 --> 00:01:41.394
COUNTRIES LIKE GUATEMALA THAT

00:01:41.395 --> 00:01:42.766
SAYS IF YOU PASS THROUGH A

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:43.665
COUNTRY THAT’S NOT YOUR OWN

00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:45.771
SEEKING ASYLUM, YOU HAVE TO MAKE

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.824
THAT ASYLUM CLAIM WHEN THE FIRST

00:01:47.859 --> 00:01:48.892
COUNTRY TO PASS THROUGH.

00:01:48.894 --> 00:01:49.834
THAT’S THE INTERNATIONAL NORM,

00:01:49.869 --> 00:01:52.310
THAT’S WHAT WE SHOULD DO.

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:53.542
JOE BIDEN COULD REIMPOSE ALL

00:01:53.577 --> 00:01:55.198
THREE OF THOSE THINGS THIS WEEK

00:01:55.232 --> 00:01:56.382
IF YOU WANTED TO.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.528
&gt;&gt; Chris: ONE OF THE THINGS I

00:01:58.562 --> 00:02:01.387
WAS STRUCK BY AT THE END OF THE

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:02.272
INTERVIEW, SECRETARY MAYORKAS

00:02:02.306 --> 00:02:04.929
SAID "THE BORDER IS SECURE, THE

00:02:04.963 --> 00:02:09.389
BORDER IS CLOSED."

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:11.183
IS IT?

00:02:11.218 --> 00:02:15.892
&gt;&gt; Senator Cotton: NO, CHRIS,

00:02:15.926 --> 00:02:17.151
OF COURSE NOT.

00:02:17.152 --> 00:02:18.555
THEY MAY SIMPLY START PROCESSING

00:02:18.589 --> 00:02:19.483
PEOPLE INTO THE COUNTRY WITHOUT

00:02:19.518 --> 00:02:21.134
EVEN GIVING THEM A NOTICE TO

00:02:21.136 --> 00:02:23.275
APPEAR IN COURT AND OF COURSE

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.611
ALL OF THESE BOGUS ASYLUM CLAIMS

00:02:24.612 --> 00:02:25.780
ARE TAKING UP SO MUCH MANPOWER

00:02:25.814 --> 00:02:27.511
AND RESOURCES OF THE BORDER,

00:02:27.545 --> 00:02:29.478
THAT MEANS THAT WE ALSO HAVE

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.421
OTHER THREATS, LIKE INCREASES IN

00:02:31.422 --> 00:02:33.728
FENTANYL AND OTHER KINDS OF DRUG

00:02:33.729 --> 00:02:35.892
TRAFFICKING OR PERSONS ON THE

00:02:35.893 --> 00:02:36.905
TERRORIST WATCH LIST CROSSING

00:02:36.906 --> 00:02:37.240
THE BORDER.

00:02:37.274 --> 00:02:38.130
THE BORDER RIGHT NOW IS WIDE

00:02:38.164 --> 00:02:39.325
OPEN BECAUSE THE BIDEN

00:02:39.326 --> 00:02:40.658
ADMINISTRATION DISMANTLED THE

00:02:40.692 --> 00:02:42.615
VERY EFFECTIVE POLICIES OF THE

00:02:42.616 --> 00:02:44.329
TRUMP ADMINISTRATION AND THE

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.976
AGREEMENTS WE HAD WITH MEXICO

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:46.887
AND OTHER LATIN AMERICAN

00:02:46.922 --> 00:02:47.587
COUNTRIES.

00:02:47.622 --> 00:02:50.098
&gt;&gt; Chris: I WANT TO TURN TO

00:02:50.099 --> 00:02:52.616
ANOTHER SUBJECT, SENATOR .

00:02:52.617 --> 00:02:54.056
YOU’VE VOTED AGAINST THE

00:02:54.057 --> 00:02:55.080
$1.9 TRILLION COVID RELIEF

00:02:55.082 --> 00:02:56.479
PACKAGE, AND I WANT TO PUT UP

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:59.220
SOME OF THE THINGS THAT IT WOULD

00:02:59.254 --> 00:03:00.758
DO FOR ARKANSAS.

00:03:00.792 --> 00:03:02.817
IT WOULD PROVIDE STIMULUS

00:03:02.851 --> 00:03:07.088
PAYMENTS OF UP TO $1400 TO 93%

00:03:07.089 --> 00:03:09.620
OF ADULTS IN YOUR STATE AND 94%

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:12.340
OF CHILDREN IN YOUR STATE.

00:03:12.341 --> 00:03:14.406
IT WOULD ALSO PROVIDE

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:17.119
$1.2 BILLION FOR SCHOOLS IN

00:03:17.153 --> 00:03:19.061
ARKANSAS, GRADES K-12.

00:03:19.095 --> 00:03:21.378
SENATOR, ARE YOU SAYING THAT THE

00:03:21.413 --> 00:03:24.345
PEOPLE OF YOUR STATE DON’T NEED

00:03:24.346 --> 00:03:24.891
THAT MONEY?

00:03:24.926 --> 00:03:25.738
&gt;&gt; Senator Cotton: CHRIS, THAT

00:03:25.739 --> 00:03:27.224
BILL WOULD DO A LOT OF OTHER

00:03:27.225 --> 00:03:28.529
THINGS AS WELL.

00:03:28.563 --> 00:03:29.894
WE’VE BEEN TALK ABOUT WHAT

00:03:29.928 --> 00:03:31.484
CAUSES BORDER CRISIS, LOOK AT A

00:03:31.519 --> 00:03:32.906
COUPLE OTHER PROVISIONS IN OUR

00:03:32.907 --> 00:03:33.198
BILL.

00:03:33.232 --> 00:03:33.913
STIMULUS CHECKS TO ILLEGAL

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:35.517
ALIENS AS WELL OR MONEY TO

00:03:35.551 --> 00:03:36.484
SANCTUARY CITIES.

00:03:36.485 --> 00:03:37.867
THOSE ARE THE KINDS OF

00:03:37.868 --> 00:03:39.236
INCENTIVES THAT HELP MIGRANTS

00:03:39.238 --> 00:03:40.466
COME TO OUR BORDER.

00:03:40.501 --> 00:03:42.617
MORE BROADLY THOUGH, WE WORKED

00:03:42.651 --> 00:03:43.790
TOGETHER LAST YEAR WITH THE

00:03:43.824 --> 00:03:44.614
DEMOCRATS IN THE TRUMP

00:03:44.649 --> 00:03:45.997
ADMINISTRATION TO PASS MULTIPLE

00:03:46.032 --> 00:03:47.163
BILLS TO HELP THE AMERICAN

00:03:47.197 --> 00:03:48.408
PEOPLE GET THROUGH THIS

00:03:48.442 --> 00:03:48.891
PANDEMIC.

00:03:48.925 --> 00:03:50.595
MANY OF THOSE BILLS PASSED

00:03:50.629 --> 00:03:50.870
UNANIMOUSLY.

00:03:50.905 --> 00:03:54.038
WE DID ONE IN DECEMBER AS WELL.

00:03:54.073 --> 00:03:55.371
THE CONDITIONS OF COURSE HAVE

00:03:55.405 --> 00:03:55.871
CHANGED NOW.

00:03:55.905 --> 00:03:58.171
VACCINES ARE SPREADING ACROSS

00:03:58.205 --> 00:03:59.986
THE COUNTRY, CASE RATES ARE

00:03:59.987 --> 00:04:00.764
DECLINING RAPIDLY.

00:04:00.766 --> 00:04:01.880
REPUBLICANS HAD NO PROBLEM

00:04:01.881 --> 00:04:03.942
PROVIDING MORE MONEY FOR VACCINE

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:05.164
DISTRIBUTION, FOR INSTANCE, OR

00:04:05.165 --> 00:04:07.507
TO HELP PEOPLE WHO HAVE LOST

00:04:07.508 --> 00:04:08.533
INCOME, BUT WE SHOULDN’T BE

00:04:08.568 --> 00:04:11.521
SPENDING $2 TRILLION ON A LOT OF

00:04:11.522 --> 00:04:12.360
UNRELATED DEMOCRATIC PRIORITIES

00:04:12.395 --> 00:04:14.024
OR SENDING MONEY TO FAMILIES

00:04:14.059 --> 00:04:17.059
THAT HAVEN’T LOST ANY INCOME.

00:04:17.061 --> 00:04:19.715
THAT’S WHAT THIS BILL DID.

00:04:19.749 --> 00:04:21.962
&gt;&gt; Chris: HERE IS ONE OF YOUR

00:04:21.996 --> 00:04:22.998
OTHER COMPLAINTS ABOUT THE COVID

00:04:22.999 --> 00:04:24.733
RELIEF BILL.

00:04:24.768 --> 00:04:26.316
TAKE A LOOK, SIR.

00:04:26.317 --> 00:04:28.386
&gt;&gt; LOOK CRAZY SOME OF THE

00:04:28.388 --> 00:04:29.463
DEMOCRATIC IDEALS ARE.

00:04:29.497 --> 00:04:31.946
THEY HAD A CHANCE ON SATURDAY

00:04:31.947 --> 00:04:34.572
MORNING TO STOP IT FROM GOING TO

00:04:34.574 --> 00:04:35.932
PRISONERS, FROM GOING TO THE

00:04:35.933 --> 00:04:37.319
BOSTON BOMBER, FOR INSTANCE AND

00:04:37.321 --> 00:04:38.961
ON THAT NOTE THEY DECLINED.

00:04:38.962 --> 00:04:40.509
EVERY SINGLE DEMOCRAT WANTED TO

00:04:40.511 --> 00:04:42.593
CONTINUE THE PRACTICE OF SENDING

00:04:42.594 --> 00:04:44.858
CHECKS TO PRISONERS.

00:04:44.859 --> 00:04:47.304
&gt;&gt; Chris: BUT SENATOR , UNDER

00:04:47.305 --> 00:04:49.068
TWO PREVIOUS COVID RELIEF BILLS

00:04:49.069 --> 00:04:51.783
THAT YOU SUPPORTED AND VOTED FOR

00:04:51.817 --> 00:04:52.991
AND THAT PRESIDENT TRUMP SIGNED,

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:55.608
PRISONERS ALSO GOT CHECKS IN

00:04:55.643 --> 00:04:56.654
THOSE BILLS.

00:04:56.689 --> 00:04:59.043
&gt;&gt; Senator Cotton: WELL,

00:04:59.077 --> 00:05:00.732
CHRIS, THAT WAS OBVIOUSLY NEVER

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:01.535
CONGRESS’ INTENT.

00:05:01.569 --> 00:05:02.902
THE TRUMPET MR. RISCH AND, IRS

00:05:02.937 --> 00:05:04.930
AND TREASURY DEPARTMENT DID NOT

00:05:04.965 --> 00:05:07.154
SEND CHECKS TO PRISONERS,

00:05:07.155 --> 00:05:08.926
LIBERAL ADVOCACY GROUPS SUED, A

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.168
JUDGE SAID THEY HAD TO.

00:05:10.169 --> 00:05:11.732
LAST MONTH -- THIS MONTH WAS THE

00:05:11.734 --> 00:05:13.210
FIRST TIME WE EVER HAD A SIMPLE

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:14.345
UP OR DOWN VOTE ON WHETHER THOSE

00:05:14.346 --> 00:05:16.213
CHECKS SHOULD GO TO PRISONERS

00:05:16.247 --> 00:05:18.219
AND THE SIMPLE FACT IS THAT

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.483
EVERY DEMOCRAT VOTED TO KEEP

00:05:19.518 --> 00:05:20.783
SENDING CHECKS TO PRISONERS.

00:05:20.817 --> 00:05:23.284
I DON’T THINK THAT’S A SMART

00:05:23.319 --> 00:05:24.514
IDEA, I SUSPECT MOST AMERICANS

00:05:24.549 --> 00:05:25.477
DON’T EITHER.

00:05:25.479 --> 00:05:27.307
&gt;&gt; Chris: ONE OF THE NEXT BIG

00:05:27.342 --> 00:05:28.598
PIECES OF LEGISLATION THAT

00:05:28.632 --> 00:05:31.468
PRESIDENT BIDEN IS WORKING ON IS

00:05:31.502 --> 00:05:33.052
GOING TO BE AN EVEN BIGGER

00:05:33.053 --> 00:05:34.531
2 TRILLION, 3 TRILLION,

00:05:34.533 --> 00:05:35.602
$4 TRILLION INFRASTRUCTURE PLAN,

00:05:35.603 --> 00:05:38.060
AND I WANT TO LOOK AT SOME OF

00:05:38.061 --> 00:05:40.473
THE INFRASTRUCTURE NEEDS THAT

00:05:40.475 --> 00:05:41.502
ARKANSAS HAS.

00:05:41.504 --> 00:05:44.579
4.9% OF THE BRIDGES IN ARKANSAS

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:47.637
ARE STRUCTURALLY DEFICIENT.

00:05:47.639 --> 00:05:50.379
193 DAMS HAVE HIGH HAZARD

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.268
POTENTIAL.

00:05:51.269 --> 00:05:54.568
DRINKING WATER NEEDS IN YOUR

00:05:54.569 --> 00:05:56.514
STATE, $7.4 BILLION.

00:05:56.549 --> 00:05:59.304
PRESIDENT BIDEN WANTS TO PAY FOR

00:05:59.338 --> 00:06:01.363
THIS PLAN AT LEAST IN PART BY

00:06:01.397 --> 00:06:03.365
RAISING TAXES ON PEOPLE MAKING

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:06.841
MORE THAN $400,000 A YEAR AND TO

00:06:06.842 --> 00:06:09.874
RAISE THE CORPORATE TAX RATE

00:06:09.909 --> 00:06:12.543
FROM 21% UP TO 28%.

00:06:12.577 --> 00:06:14.978
WOULD YOU SUPPORT -- I MEAN,

00:06:14.979 --> 00:06:17.209
AREN’T THE NEEDS IN ARKANSAS

00:06:17.243 --> 00:06:18.257
SUFFICIENTLY URGENT THAT YOU

00:06:18.292 --> 00:06:20.687
COULD SUPPORT TAXING PEOPLE

00:06:20.688 --> 00:06:22.364
MAKING MORE THAN $400,000 AND

00:06:22.399 --> 00:06:23.476
RAISING THE TAX RATE ON

00:06:23.477 --> 00:06:25.045
CORPORATIONS, WHICH IS STILL

00:06:25.046 --> 00:06:26.354
LOWER THAN WHEN -- WOULD STILL

00:06:26.388 --> 00:06:27.559
BE LOWER THAN WHEN

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:30.441
PRESIDENT TRUMP CAME INTO OFFICE

00:06:30.443 --> 00:06:31.849
TO PAY FOR THAT?

00:06:31.851 --> 00:06:33.121
&gt;&gt; Senator Cotton: CHRIS, WE

00:06:33.122 --> 00:06:34.974
HAVE INFRASTRUCTURE NEEDS IN

00:06:34.976 --> 00:06:36.178
ARKANSAS, LIKE EVERY STATE DOES,

00:06:36.179 --> 00:06:37.889
BUT I SUSPECT BASED ON WHAT

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:39.073
EFFORT MY DEMOCRATIC FRIENDS IN

00:06:39.075 --> 00:06:40.845
THE SENATE THAT THIS BILL IS NOT

00:06:40.847 --> 00:06:42.842
GOING TO BE GEARED TO ALERTS

00:06:42.843 --> 00:06:44.371
THOSE NEEDS, IT’S GOING TO BE

00:06:44.372 --> 00:06:45.274
GEARED TOWARDS BIG TAX INCREASES

00:06:45.308 --> 00:06:46.562
END UP LAMENTING SOMETHING LIKE

00:06:46.596 --> 00:06:47.564
THE GREEN NEW DEAL.

00:06:47.565 --> 00:06:49.278
IF YOU THINK YOUR GAS BILLS HAVE

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:50.754
GONE UP A LOT RECENTLY, WAIT

00:06:50.755 --> 00:06:51.861
UNTIL YOU SEE WHAT YOU PAY AT

00:06:51.894 --> 00:06:52.866
THE PUMP AFTER THE DEMOCRATS DO

00:06:52.867 --> 00:06:53.285
THAT.

00:06:53.286 --> 00:06:55.359
WE CAN DO THIS KIND OF BILL

00:06:55.361 --> 00:06:56.270
WITHOUT BIG TAX HIKES.

00:06:56.271 --> 00:06:57.600
THE REASON WE ARE TALKING ABOUT

00:06:57.602 --> 00:06:58.967
AN INFRASTRUCTURE BILL RIGHT NOW

00:06:59.001 --> 00:07:00.650
IS THAT THE LAST BILL WE PASSED

00:07:00.652 --> 00:07:02.413
IS ABOUT TO EXPIRE INTO THIS

00:07:02.447 --> 00:07:04.023
YEAR AND WE PASSED THAT BILL IN

00:07:04.057 --> 00:07:05.142
2015 WITH MORE THAN 80 VOTES IN

00:07:05.177 --> 00:07:06.557
THE UNITED STATES SENATE,

00:07:06.558 --> 00:07:07.503
WITHOUT TAX INCREASES BURIED

00:07:07.538 --> 00:07:09.263
WITH FOCUSED ON A LOT OF THE

00:07:09.298 --> 00:07:10.399
PROBLEMS WE HAVE WITH

00:07:10.401 --> 00:07:11.379
INFRASTRUCTURE IN THIS COUNTRY,

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.235
LIKE EXCESSIVELY BURDENSOME AND

00:07:14.269 --> 00:07:16.071
LENGTHY AND CUMBERSOME

00:07:16.073 --> 00:07:17.514
PERMITTING AND REGULATORY AND

00:07:17.515 --> 00:07:18.123
ENVIRONMENTAL APPROVAL

00:07:18.124 --> 00:07:18.485
PROCESSES.

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.231
CHRIS, YOU PROBABLY KNOW THAT

00:07:20.232 --> 00:07:22.168
THE PENTAGON WAS BUILT IN 16

00:07:22.202 --> 00:07:23.146
MONTHS IN THE 1940s.

00:07:23.181 --> 00:07:24.474
IT TOOK THE GOVERNMENT YEARS TO

00:07:24.509 --> 00:07:26.638
REPAIR A BRIDGE IN FRONT OF THE

00:07:26.639 --> 00:07:27.792
PENTAGON THAT JUST RUNS A COUPLE

00:07:27.794 --> 00:07:28.149
HUNDRED FEET.

00:07:28.151 --> 00:07:29.219
THE PROBLEMS THAT WE HAVE IN

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:30.882
THIS COUNTRY IS NOT THAT WE

00:07:30.916 --> 00:07:32.101
DON’T HAVE ENOUGH MONEY FOR

00:07:32.135 --> 00:07:32.450
INFRASTRUCTURE.

00:07:32.451 --> 00:07:34.078
IT’S THAT IT COSTS TOO MUCH AND

00:07:34.079 --> 00:07:35.619
THAT WE SPEND TOO MUCH ON THINGS

00:07:35.653 --> 00:07:38.134
THAT ARE NOT ROADS AND BRIDGES

00:07:38.168 --> 00:07:39.120
AND BROADBAND ACCESS.

00:07:39.121 --> 00:07:40.443
&gt;&gt; Chris: RIGHT.

00:07:40.444 --> 00:07:43.355
FINALLY, I’VE GOT ABOUT A MINUTE

00:07:43.356 --> 00:07:45.489
LEFT HERE, SIR, PRESIDENT BIDEN

00:07:45.491 --> 00:07:47.011
TALKED THIS WEEK ABOUT TRYING TO

00:07:47.012 --> 00:07:49.126
REFORM, NOT END, BUT TO REFORM

00:07:49.127 --> 00:07:51.353
THE FILIBUSTER SO THAT SENATORS

00:07:51.388 --> 00:07:55.283
HAVE TO KEEP TALKING AROUND THE

00:07:55.317 --> 00:07:57.848
CLOCK IN ORDER TO CONTINUE THE

00:07:57.882 --> 00:07:59.183
FILIBUSTER AND TO STOP THE

00:07:59.184 --> 00:07:59.742
LEGISLATION.

